WEBVTT

00:08:59.836 --> 00:09:03.676
“uninhabited by human”
places in the world,

00:09:03.716 --> 00:09:05.596
you’re going to get jumping of species.

00:09:05.636 --> 00:09:09.596
Or in markets where you put
animals from the wild

00:09:09.596 --> 00:09:10.996
in contact with humans,

00:09:10.996 --> 00:09:14.556
which is exactly what happened
with SARS-CoV-1

00:09:14.596 --> 00:09:18.316
and highly likely happened
with SARS-CoV-2.

00:09:18.676 --> 00:09:21.436
We will continue to get outbreaks.

00:09:21.476 --> 00:09:25.516
Pandemic flu generally comes
from a situation

00:09:25.516 --> 00:09:30.156
where you have the animal species
that harbor influenza,